						 <p>If you are referring to edit 919, the editor specifically commented:</p> <blockquote> <p>Yes Taylor, I edited it this time, to remove rapey, pedophiliac, and unfunny content.</p> </blockquote> <p>Which is absolutely correct. Pedophilia and rape are not funny and should not be made light of anywhere. One of the primary reasons for this page no longer being open to collaborative edits is due to staff having to repeatedly remove content like this and similar. This removal falls under staff mandate and was appropriate.</p> <p>Accusing someone of doing this as an attempt to &quot;hide the fact they are a pedophile&quot; is unsubstantiated and entirely inappropriate.</p> <p><strong>This is a CLOSED staff post. Do not respond to this reply thread unless you are staff.</strong></p> 
